  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Qaryati AlMoustadama Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative aims to tackle the socio-economic challenges driving rural youth migration in the oriental region to urban areas by implementing a bottom-up development approach that builds the capacity of various local, provincial, and regional actors. The qa initiative will focus on the oriental region, while leveraging strong established relationships with the nearest local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
